&lt;li&gt;US employees in New York City, San Francisco, Los Angeles, and Seattle: $154,200 - $192,800&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US employees outside of the New York City, San Francisco, Los Angeles, and Seattle: $138,800 - $173,500&lt;/li&gt;
