&lt;li&gt;Our target new hire base salary ranges for this role are the following:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US employees in New York City, Los Angeles, Seattle, or the San Francisco Bay Area: &lt;strong&gt;$199,900 - 249,900&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US employees outside of the New York City, Los Angeles, Seattle, or the San Francisco Bay Area: &lt;strong&gt;$179,900 - 224,900&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
